{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41685","headline":"寄兵部任畹郎中 · 陈陶","name":"寄兵部任畹郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常思剑浦越清尘，荳蔻花红十二春。\n崑玉已成廊庙器，涧松犹是薜萝身。\n虽同橘柚依南土，终媿魁罡近北辰。\n好向昌时荐遗逸，莫教千古吊灵均。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41685.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41685","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}